WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:25.560
Today...

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:28.690
...an important development
taking us...

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:31.390
...right to the very core of this
drama will take place.

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:34.980
Now, do you remember
this particular Fighter?

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:38.820
Neo England
John Bull Gundam

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:36.610
That's right.

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.700
He's Chapman of Neo England.

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:58.970
He has proved to be quite
the invincible hero.

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:02.300
But, like Michelo Chariot...

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:03.810
...he was once defeated
by Domon Kasshu...

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:08.560
...yet he didn't lose his
right to participate in the Finals.

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:12.730
This Gundam Fight is truly
wrapped in a thick fog.

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:14.480
Chapman's opponent today...

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:18.570
...is George de Sand's Gundam Rose,
representing Neo France.

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:21.070
However...

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:23.370
...one of the mysterious Gundams...

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:27.500
...that attacked Domon as he
rushed toward the Tournament...

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.120
...seems to be setting an evil trap.

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:31.500
And now!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:36.170
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:42.220
Emissary of Darkness!
Chapman Rises Again

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:47.470
It's dreadful!

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:50.270
Making Chapman fight
additional matches?!

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.390
I won't allow it!

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:53.440
Now, Sir William...

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:55.940
...I can appreciate why
this troubles you.

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:58.740
But, please,
you must calm yourself.

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:00.450
As long as we continue to win...

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:03.490
...all is well, don't you think?

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:05.490
It's not at all well!

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:08.540
To uphold our nation's regard
for honor and justice...

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:12.080
...John Bull Gundam must
withdraw from the Tournament...

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:13.880
...and return to the Colony!

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.880
I am clearly against that.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.500
Sir Whitney...

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:20.260
...since when did your
mind become corrupt?!

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:22.180
What do you mean?

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.020
It's the one you're expecting.

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:33.770
Let's discuss this later.

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:35.860
Excuse me. My guest has arrived.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.230
Whitney!

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.040
Wow!

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.710
If there was no barrier,
we'd be toast.

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:10.560
Seems Domon's got this
match wrapped up.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:11.310
Looks like it.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:17.940
Shield barrier output
within plus or minus 0.5.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:20.860
Presently maintaining
ideal output levels.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.490
Everything satisfactory.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:25.200
A whole different battle when
it's a favored Fighter.

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.200
Look. His finishing move.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.710
Here I go!

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:39.750
This hand of mine is burning red!

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:43.460
Its loud roar tells me
to grasp victory!

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.220
Erupting...

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:49.140
...God Finger!

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:57.270
Heat End!

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.110
<i>God Gundam is strong!</i>

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:08.320
<i>Victory is attained in a mere</i>
<i>three minutes and 56 seconds!</i>

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:11.700
After all, he's strong enough
to duel with George.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:12.790
Domon Kasshu.

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:14.450
Miss Maria Louise.

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:17.420
The Neo France lodge is near.

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.960
I think your father
will be surprised.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:21.630
You've come unannounced.

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:23.050
I hope he won't be upset.

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:34.600
Maria Louise...

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.100
...when did you arrive on Earth?

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:39.190
I will not put up with
your antics this time.

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:42.570
Father, please. You haven't seen
your daughter for some time.

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:44.190
Dear George...

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:45.650
...how have you been keeping?

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:47.320
I'm well...

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:48.400
...Miss Maria Louise.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:52.200
Were you about to
head off somewhere?

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.410
To Neo England's Consulate.

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.830
I have a few inquiries to make
about Chapman.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.000
Fine.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.170
Then we shall go.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:02.500
What's the point of you going?

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:05.800
I'd grow bored waiting here
for George to return.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.510
Come on. Let's go.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:08.910
Miss Maria Louise!

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:10.300
Hey, Maria Louise!

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:19.480
So, what are you going to ask?

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:22.610
For a while I've had grave
doubts about Chapman.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.520
Grave doubts?

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:25.400
Yes.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.490
So I wanted to clarify
some issues...

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.620
...before my match against him.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:34.410
Stop the car.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:37.620
Domon Kasshu!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.870
Could we speak for a moment?

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.170
George?

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:42.380
Oh.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:43.580
The Princess is with you.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.050
Yuck.

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:48.420
This tastes weird.

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:51.680
I can't believe you guys
drink this stuff.

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:52.340
Huh?

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:54.890
But this is yummy.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:57.350
Bye.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.190
What's wrong, Domon?

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:05.860
Let's go eat and celebrate!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:06.940
Before that...

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:09.030
...I'm going to smoke out
some rats.

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:10.360
Huh?

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:17.080
So...

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.370
...Chapman's next opponent...

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:22.040
...is Gundam Rose of Neo France.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.670
That will surely be a win for us.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.090
What?

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:28.990
The Fighter from Neo France?

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:31.260
Fine.

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.020
I'll see him.

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:36.600
Then you'll handle the issue
of Sir William?

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:43.980
Miss Maria Louise.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:45.360
Yes, I know.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.900
But don't you find them rude,
making us wait so long?

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.150
Where are you going...?!

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.110
I'm going out for a walk.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:58.280
I should've stayed behind.

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:01.450
Then I could've snuck out
to get something good to eat.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:03.580
What are you doing?!

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:06.140
Did you bring me out here
so you could kill me?!

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:12.970
S-stop it.

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:15.640
Silencing me won't change
the fact that...

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:18.890
...you will eventually be
judged for your actions!

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:20.890
Chapman!

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:22.600
What's happened to you?!

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:26.830
I thought you represented the
gentlemanly spirit of Neo England!

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:31.820
S-stay back!

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:45.710
How rude!
What're you doing?!

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.330
Help me, George!

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:48.750
Hold it!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.420
What're you doing to
Miss Maria Louise?!

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:52.590
George! He's a murderer!

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:55.050
This man took someone's life!

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:02.470
He killed someone?

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:03.730
I'm sure of it.

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:05.810
I saw it with my own eyes.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:12.030
What a surprise.

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:14.780
You're supposed to be dead,
but you kill another!

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:17.630
What's going on, Chapman?!

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:21.740
Ever since the beginning
of the Final Battle...

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:23.660
...it's been perplexing me.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:26.330
How can someone come back
from the grave...

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.250
...and take part in the Finals?

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:36.340
What the...?!

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:38.630
His techniques have
seriously improved!

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:42.970
George!

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:45.640
He's strong.

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:46.810
This strength...

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:52.730
The crest is glowing!

00:09:56.940 --> 00:09:58.950
Th-those are...

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:00.030
...DG cells!

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.460
Miss Maria Louise!
Forgive me!

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:12.750
Domon.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:14.880
Why did we come out here?

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:16.140
Rat...

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:18.260
Don't you want to catch one?

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:22.640
Hey.

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.890
I don't see rats around here.

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:25.930
In here.

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:28.020
There's a rat hiding right in here.

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:29.480
In here?

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:35.780
Domon!

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:37.860
I thought I'd drop in on you.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.360
Rain, look!

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:42.740
There's a huge rat!

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:43.870
Chapman!

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:46.080
They're coming, too!

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:49.460
Allenby.

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:50.250
Can you handle the little ones?

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.040
Sure thing!

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:56.380
So, Chapman...

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:59.220
...we finally meet face to face.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.970
I got a lot of things
I want to ask you.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:04.600
You'd better give me the answers.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:15.770
H-hey, these are...!

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.570
As you see, they're DG cells.

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:19.440
What?

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:34.000
You all right, Allenby?!

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:35.630
That hurts...

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.670
That's not just any guy.

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:38.460
Nope.

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.800
You slipped up, Chapman.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:46.960
But on the next round,
I'm going to give you a hand.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:56.020
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:00.400
No.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:02.820
I'm sure Sir William was killed.

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:07.330
But the Neo England people say
the cause was a heart attack.

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:09.160
That's obviously a lie!

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.950
I saw it with my own eyes.

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:13.870
I saw Chapman kill him.

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:15.330
Also...

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:21.960
Come to think of it,
there was another man there!

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:22.670
Another man?

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:23.880
That's right.

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:25.470
I couldn't see his face...

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:27.640
...but he must've been in on it!

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.680
George de Sand.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:32.850
As it is, you must find out
the truth at tomorrow's match.

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:33.980
Yes!

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.650
With a knight's honor...

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.940
...I will deliver justice
upon Chapman.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:40.820
<i>Now!</i>

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:44.030
<i>In today's Gundam Fight</i>
<i>at the main rink on the sea</i>...

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:46.990
...<i>the match between Neo</i>
<i>England's John Bull Gundam</i>...

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:51.790
...<i>and Neo France's Gundam Rose</i>
<i>is about to begin</i>.

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:58.250
The other man...

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.090
...whoever he was...

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.840
I'm sure he's here today.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:11.310
Hey, Domon.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:14.430
Think this match will
turn out okay?

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:15.230
No.

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:17.440
Something will happen.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.310
I've got a hunch about this.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.120
It's time, Chapman!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.710
I'll bury you so that you'll
never return...

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:44.630
...to use your dirty tricks on us!

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:46.630
It ends with this match!

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.130
Ready!

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:49.220
Go!

00:14:01.560 --> 00:14:02.270
What?

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:03.570
Domon...

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:04.860
...something's wrong
with the barrier.

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:07.280
Come with me!
Allenby! Rain!

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:10.320
I'm borrowing this.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:15.500
Never thought they'd
mess with the barrier.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.920
M-Miss Maria Louise...

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:24.270
What...

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.380
...what just happened here?

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:29.050
Listen carefully.

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:31.390
If you move from that position...

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:33.470
...I'll shut down the rest
of the barrier.

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:36.240
If you want to protect
the spectators...

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:39.190
...just make sure you stay
right where you are.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.520
What are you up to?!

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:42.770
Stop this stupid charade!

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:43.860
Shut up!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:46.230
Do you understand me,
young lady?

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:48.860
I understand.

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.570
Let's do as he says, Father.

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:52.280
Now, George.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:55.030
If you don't want the
young lady killed...

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:57.910
...you'll have to shield her.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.000
Villain...

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:03.630
Now, Chapman.
Preparations are complete.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:06.210
You can now do as you wish.

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:11.470
You'll pay, Chapman!

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:16.680
George!

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:19.100
Miss Maria Louise!

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:21.310
Please endure this
for a short while...

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:25.650
...until I, George de Sand,
defeat Chapman!

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:29.740
<i>Well! What's going on here?!</i>

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:31.900
<i>Gundam Rose hasn't moved!</i>

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:34.990
<i>He's just standing there taking</i>
<i>hits from John Bull Gundam!</i>

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.830
Hold on, George!

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:46.250
Those who get in our way...

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:48.550
...should be silenced like this.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:49.880
Chapman!

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.760
How about we settle it now?!

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:00.390
George!

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:03.600
Oh, no!

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:05.100
Miss Maria Louise!

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:08.070
Look! The area behind you
is wide open!

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.160
Miss Maria Louise!

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:24.120
Stop!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:26.210
I won't let you!

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:29.550
Bastard!

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.130
Rain! The barrier!

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:36.430
There! Push that lever up!

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:37.100
Hurry!

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:38.470
This one?

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:39.600
You bastard!

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:40.600
Shut up!

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:41.180
Hurry!

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:42.100
Right!

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.230
Miss Maria Louise!

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.080
Maria Louise...

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:02.240
Good. We succeeded.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:06.540
You're Michelo!

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:10.670
Getting in my way again,
Domon Kasshu!

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:11.920
Retreat!

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:15.090
That man's from Neo England.

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:23.020
I suppose the fun is over now.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:24.020
No.

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:26.770
Today's show is only now
getting interesting.

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.060
Chapman.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:32.030
All of your insults against
Miss Maria Louise!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:34.610
I shall not forgive you for them!

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:36.190
Rose Bits!

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.290
Go!

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:54.590
Chapman...

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:57.840
...this is an appropriate end
for a coward like yourself.

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:58.840
Now...

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:01.800
...confess to the murder
of Sir William!

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:14.860
Y-you're kidding.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:23.910
It's the same as before.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.010
G-George!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:40.970
George!

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:42.100
<i>Oh, wow!</i>

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.930
<i>What happened inside the</i>
<i>sudden blanket of smoke?!</i>

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:47.390
<i>Gundam Rose has been</i>
<i>skewered like meat!</i>

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:55.730
A Gundam?!

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:16.630
What in the world is this?

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.820
That one attacked me.

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:39.030
Get away! George!

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.410
But...

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:44.740
I-I know.

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:48.080
There's a way! Will it work?!
Rose Bits!

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:33.120
Domon Kasshu,
I'm in your debt.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.830
Thanks to you, I was able
to protect Miss Maria Louise.

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:38.000
Well...

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:41.210
...I'm more worried about the
strange Gundam that attacked you.

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:42.380
Yes.

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:44.720
What could that Gundam be?

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:47.390
George de Sand.

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:51.100
I enjoyed watching your Fight.

00:20:51.470 --> 00:20:54.980
You did well to defeat
the powerful Chapman.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.480
Undefeated of the East!

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:58.770
Perfect!
I've got questions!

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:00.480
Come on now.

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:04.280
We should first let George get
some rest before any discussions.

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:07.450
Excuse me.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:10.370
Wh-why that's...

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:16.330
I'm positive.

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:19.920
The other man at the scene
of the murder...

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:21.550
...was Mr. Wong of Neo Hong Kong!

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:25.380
If what you say is true...

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:27.140
...then forget what happened.

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:29.430
Why should I, Father?

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:30.600
Listen...

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:32.310
...if he so wishes it...

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:36.520
...Mr. Wong can easily drop
Neo France from the Tournament.

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:37.730
What?

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:39.150
That's right.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:41.570
We cannot turn against the man.

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:45.240
Not while he's the supreme
ruler of space.

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:48.910
Yes.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:51.280
I have absolute power now.

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:54.950
And this power of mine
is about to become eternal.

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:04.670
Look.

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:28.280
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:30.780
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:36.080
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:38.620
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.580 --> 00:22:43.750
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:47.420
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.420 --> 00:22:54.140
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.390 --> 00:23:01.690
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:06.230
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:09.820
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.860 --> 00:23:17.290
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:26.130
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:33.510 --> 00:23:35.390
Everyone, it's the moment you've
been waiting for!

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:39.020
The big secret of the Devil Gundam
hiding within Neo Hong Kong.

00:23:39.020 --> 00:23:41.810
Wong sets a trap after his
secret is revealed...

00:23:41.810 --> 00:23:44.810
...and this turns out to be an
unprecedented Double Fight!

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:47.280
Ashura Gundam and
Skull Gundam...

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:49.940
...launch a fierce
tag team assault!

00:23:50.280 --> 00:23:52.070
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.070 --> 00:23:55.780
Stand Up, Domon!
Raging Tag Team Match!

00:23:54.320 --> 00:24:01.440
Stand Up, Domon!
Raging Tag Team Match!

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:58.240
Ready! Go!
